  (text "STM32H745ZIT6 Dual-Core ARM Cortex-M7/M4\n- M7: 480 MHz, 1 MB ITCM + 128 KB DTCM\n- M4: 240 MHz, 64 KB ITCM + 128 KB DTCM\n- 2 MB internal Flash (1 MB per core)\n- 2 MB AXI-SRAM + CCM\n- Quad-SPI, Dual I2C, UART, USB HS, CAN\n- Temperature range: -40 to +85 °C" (at 150 350 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
    (uuid "mcu-annotation")
  )

  (text "Power Distribution:\n- Input: 12V via barrel connector (1A max)\n- TPS62133A buck converter: 12V → 5V/1A\n- LDO 1: 5V → 3.3V/500mA (digital)\n- LDO 2: 5V → 1.8V/200mA (IO bank)\n- All supplies decoupled with 100nF ceramic + 10µF electrolytics\n- Reverse polarity protection via Schottky diode" (at 150 420 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
    (uuid "power-annotation")
  )

  (text "Sensor Interfaces:\n- SPI1: ICM-20689 9-axis IMU (1 kHz sampling)\n  Clock: 10 MHz, CS on PB0\n- I2C1: VL53L0X laser rangefinder (50 Hz)\n- I2C1: MCP9808 barrel temperature (1 Hz)\n- I2C1: BMP390 pressure/ambient temp (10 Hz)\n- All sensors use 3.3V IO, pull-ups on I2C lines (10k to VCC_3V3)\n- SPI termination: 50Ω series resistors on clock/data" (at 150 490 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
    (uuid "sensor-annotation")
  )

  (text "External Memory:\n- W25Q128JV QSPI Flash: 16 MB (108 MHz)\n  Quad mode: D0=PD11, D1=PD12, D2=PE2, D3=PD13\n  CS on PB6 (AF10), clock on PB2 (AF9)\n  NOTE rev1.0 fix: CS moved PA3->PB6 (PA3 = USART2_RX)\n  Stores all ballistic session logs\n- AT24C256C I2C EEPROM: 32 KB\n  Stores configuration, calibration, firmware backup\n  Addr: 0xA0-0xAF (write-protect pin grounded)" (at 150 560 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
    (uuid "memory-annotation")
  )

  (text "Communication:\n- UART2 (PA2/PA3): 921600 baud debug output\n  CP2102N USB-UART bridge for host connectivity\n- USB HS OTG: Configuration per requirements (TODO in v2.0)\n  DP on PA11, DM on PA12\n  Dual-role: device (log download) or host (accessory)\n- Bluetooth LE (TBD): BT121-A module on UART4\n  Mobile app integration (future roadmap v1.5+)" (at 150 630 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
    (uuid "comm-annotation")
  )

  (text "Clock & Reset:\n- HSE (High-Speed External): 8 MHz crystal + caps\n  PH0-OSC_IN, PH1-OSC_OUT\n- PLL1: 8 MHz × 60 = 480 MHz (M7 core clock)\n- PLL2: 8 MHz × 60 = 480 MHz (M4 core clock, div by 2)\n- Reset circuit: capacitive filtering on NRST\n- Watchdog: Independent WDG + software monitor\n  Timeout: 5 seconds (tunable in firmware)\n- BOOT0 switch for bootloader entry (factory reset)" (at 150 700 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
    (uuid "clock-annotation")
  )

  (text "Safety & Protection:\n- Schottky reverse-polarity diode on VCC_12V input\n- RC filter on NRST: 10k/100nF (debounce 1ms)\n- MPU (Memory Protection Unit): Configured in firmware\n  - DTCM & AXI-SRAM: Write/execute-never for stack overflow\n  - Flash: Read-only after boot\n- CRC32 on all Flash packets (session logs)\n- Watchdog independent of software state\n  - Strobed by M7 sensor_fusion_task every 100ms\n  - Failure triggers NRST and halt (safe state)" (at 150 770 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
    (uuid "safety-annotation")
  )

  (text "Test Points & Debug:\n- SWD connector (10-pin ARM standard)\n  - SWDIO on PA13, SWDCLK on PA14\n  - Compatible with ST-Link v2/v3\n- UART2 exposed on 3-pin header (TX/RX/GND)\n- All power rails brought to multimeter test points\n- VCC_3V3, VCC_1V8, VREF, GND accessible\n- Current monitoring via series resistor (10 mΩ) in main rail" (at 150 840 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
    (uuid "test-annotation")
  )

  (text "PCB Layout Notes:\n- 4-layer: Signal, GND, VCC, Signal\n- 50Ω impedance control for QSPI traces (high-speed digital)\n- GND stitching via around all high-current areas\n- Decoupling capacitors placed <5mm from IC pins\n- Crystal load capacitors: 12pF (matching pair, 1%)\n- Via count: >4 per signal (fan-out from BGA)" (at 150 910 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
    (uuid "pcb-annotation")
  )

  (text "Assembly & Validation:\n- LQFP144 package: leads on 0.5mm pitch\n- Thermal pad (exposed pad) soldered for heat dissipation\n- Test program validates:\n  - Clock tree (verify PLL lock)\n  - Voltage rails (±5% at no load)\n  - SPI/I2C communication (loopback test)\n  - Flash read/write (CRC check)\n  - Watchdog firing (software trigger)\n- Production: AOI + X-ray for solder joint quality" (at 150 980 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
    (uuid "assembly-annotation")
  )

  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )

)
